**Summary:** 1 critical finding. The `aggregation_check.rs` module was declared in `mod.rs` at the initial commit (`67f28b7`, 2026-03-19) but the file was never created — no deletion commit exists, and all 6 sibling modules were committed at the same time. This causes `error[E0583]` and blocks compilation. Beyond the dead reference, the entire `tests/regression/` suite is orphaned (no crate owns it in the virtual workspace), and the `hares-fleet` aggregation function has only synthetic unit tests with no regression coverage against real simulation results.
